[{"title":"虞美人 题“钟馗览镜图”，为闰重午作","author":"赵我佩","text":"弹冠重下终南径。\n真面须重省。\n红妆小妹定嘲它。\n如戟须眉还有、照菱花。\n盈樽蒲酿从新倒。\n一醉掀髯笑。\n莫欺进士老龙钟。\n不见当年人镜、兆芙蓉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉漏迟 月湖夜泛","author":"赵我佩","text":"迢迢银汉路，嫦娥睡起，碧天云暮。\n柳外凉蟾，照出暝烟千缕。\n雨过山青欲滴，似和泪、个人眉妩。\n花不语。\n红船撑入，翠乡深处。\n谁家水调歌成，怕唱彻菱塘，惊它鸥鹭。\n薄衬冰绡，清逗满身香露。\n安得今宵酒醒，把残月、晓风留住。\n欢易去。\n思量旧游无据。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扫花游 题罗镜泉“琼台梦月图”","author":"赵我佩","text":"枕函睡蝶，化瘦影飞来，晚凉琼岛。\n乱山翠绕。\n记当年倦旅，石梁慵眺。\n梦入天台，不辨云深路窈。\n镜波照、正月满兔辉，风露寒峭。\n芳事知未了。\n有洞开桃花，对人含笑。\n佩环韵悄。\n听霓裳夜咏，玉真归早。\n怨煞溪流，暗促霜华鬓老。\n卧游到。\n问苍苔、可留鸿爪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"霓裳中序第一 过旧居感赋，用草窗韵","author":"赵我佩","text":"苔衣冷翠叠。\n乱石荒阶飞败叶。\n蛛网当门暗结。\n有古甃絮蛩，颓垣筛月。\n香罗腻雪。\n剩绣巾和泪封箧。\n沧桑事，旧时燕子，软语向侬说。\n悲切。\n短歌声咽。\n叹转眼浮云变灭。\n妆楼曾记赋别。\n怕觅当时，玉佩珊玦。\n唾壶敲又缺。\n早谱就幽兰怨阕。\n休重问，花前盟约，梦断故园蝶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲 悼黄苕仙表妹","author":"赵我佩","text":"丝藕萦愁抱。\n闷恹恹、画屏无睡，坐看天晓。\n玉镜尘封钗股折，凉煞蜻蜓翠小。\n叹容易、咏花人老。\n锦瑟年华如水逝，剩红冰、渍满乌阑稿。\n幽梦醒，怨啼鸟。\n清风明月双溪棹。\n忆当时、凌波顾影，鬓鸦低照。\n怊怅彩鸾仙去后，秋雨今年更早。\n早一架、牵牛开了。\n侬是伤秋兼惜别，锁连环、恨叶眉慵扫。\n琴韵绝，伯牙调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"赵我佩","text":"密织鱼鳞百尺蓬。\n绿阴阴里小帘栊。\n水窗凉透菰蒲雨，月榭香生菡萏风。\n眉敛翠，颊销红。\n病馀鸾镜掩青铜。\n晚来谁弄阳关笛，吹出垂杨古苑东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台城路 秋夜不寐，有怀昔游，叠前韵","author":"赵我佩","text":"玉笙吹彻无眠夜，桐阴半阶烟暝。\n鬓亸云松，眉弯月瘦，坐看烛花红凝。\n银涛万顷。\n正帘卷秋河，倚妆人靓。\n目断青鸾，星桥水冱碧空静。\n菱塘曾记泛艇。\n一肩荷露重，凉坠钗影。\n艳谱乌丝，香浮翠盏，绣槛宵来闲凭。\n鸥盟未冷。\n奈赢得清愁，幻成新病。\n梵磬圆催，甚时尘梦醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧游 题张仲甫舍人“香溪泛宅图”","author":"赵我佩","text":"泛香溪一舸，帆影天边，远落云浔。\n橹唱斜阳外，待浮家去也，载鹤携琴。\n未忘五湖烟水，鸥鹭旧知音。\n看胜迹依然，馆娃宫里，响屧廊深。\n重寻。\n昔游地，听古寺钟敲，翠耸遥岑。\n易冷笙歌梦，剩酒痕浓晕，犹恋罗襟。\n而今鬓霜催老，憔悴少年心。\n只添了新词，旗亭画壁扶醉吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶杯 晚寒","author":"沈榛","text":"惊听春禽闹处。\n曙窗一枕梦黄梁。\n小楼寒透郁金床。\n凉么凉。\n凉么凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 晚步","author":"沈榛","text":"闲晚步，綦迹印苔深。\n蕉响疏风来别院，烟迷宿鸟语幽林。\n明月出花阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 春暮","author":"沈榛","text":"繁红落尽绿阴稠。\n几度寻芳帆小舟。\n九十春光逐水流。\n点点杨花波面浮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金字经 江上晚归","author":"沈榛","text":"云横迷远岫，波净趁轻鸥。\n江边傍晚一归舟。\n垂杨岸，蓼花洲。\n天欲暝，载月任遨游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 秋闺","author":"沈榛","text":"兔影纱窗移过。\n绿竹风敲声破。\n秋冷透罗衣，形影平分两个。\n孤坐。\n孤坐。\n玉漏清砧相和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 春景","author":"沈榛","text":"袅袅垂杨临水。\n庭下杏花开未。\n明月蓦移来，透破玉床鸳被。\n无寐。\n无寐。\n又被鸟声惊起。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思 春暮","author":"沈榛","text":"云悠悠。\n水悠悠。\n花落青苔触目愁。\n悲怀倚画楼。\n蜂意休。\n蝶意休。\n寂寞风光却似秋。\n东君那可留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昭君怨 春闺","author":"沈榛","text":"春色今年偏早。\n窗外杏花开了。\n无语倚阑干。\n耐轻寒。\n可奈愁人时候。\n泪脸红如晕酒。\n午梦蓦然惊。\n恨啼莺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 旅思","author":"沈榛","text":"孤馆清幽，一年又是春将半。\n野花矜艳。\n梅落随风片。\n好梦谁惊，黄鸟啼还断。\n纱窗畔。\n斜阳无限。\n愁见春光面。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 答平远翁送金桃作","author":"沈榛","text":"露井夭桃尽落花。\n结成红实点丹砂。\n相贻珍重胜灵瓜。\n疑是瑶池王母种，柔荑试刨露金芽。\n东方三窃岂须夸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 闺思","author":"沈榛","text":"朵朵鲜花吹暮烟。\n飞香风送小池莲。\n隔林鸟语自绵绵。\n独倚画阑深结恨，每凭绣榻不成眠。\n无心相向镜台前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 回文","author":"沈榛","text":"白萍浮雪流波碧。\n碧波流雪浮萍白。\n春去忽惊人。\n人惊忽去春。\n雁飞高岫远。\n远岫高飞雁。\n楼上怯深愁。\n愁深怯上楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丑奴儿 题画","author":"沈榛","text":"青山碧水无穷景，渔父垂钩。\n轻帆扁舟。\n烟雾苍茫远浦浮。\n轻云几点波中映，红蓼滩头。\n试起新篘。\n聊以衔杯忘却愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巫山一段云 暑夕","author":"沈榛","text":"微汗凝霞脸，轻风逗宝鬘。\n徐徐散步月弯环。\n时听竹珊珊。\n自觉罗衣厚，难将纨扇闲。\n榴花含露色斑斑。\n烟雾远迷山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巫山一段云 美人","author":"沈榛","text":"睡起云鬟乱，行来莲步娇。\n风前旖旎亸纤腰。\n腻脸晕红潮。\n欲舞垂罗袖，临妆整玉翘。\n踏青携伴摘兰苕。\n远望已魂销。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒金门 落花","author":"沈榛","text":"风正陡。\n枝上乍惊消瘦。\n寂寂青条空独秀。\n东君还顾否。\n无奈莺啼长昼。\n苦自将春拖逗。\n片片随风零落后。\n芳魂归碧甃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阮郎归 题倦绣仕女图","author":"沈榛","text":"竹窗斜日漾茶烟。\n佳人倦欲眠。\n停针无语线慵添。\n悲怀意怅然。\n花隐雾，柳飞绵。\n困人春暮天。\n回文未就乱鸦还。\n愁情梦里传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朝中措 月华五色","author":"沈榛","text":"溶溶万里碧天清。\n一镜玉轮明。\n五色瑞华萦绕，璨然片片云英。\n浮光烂漫，银蟾煜煜，雾吹霞横。\n露冷风轻堪爱，澄辉远映蓬瀛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"眼儿媚 秋闺","author":"沈榛","text":"秋草萋萋夕阳西。\n点点泪痕低。\n一声画角，数行疏柳，寂寞鸦啼。\n雁书不见天涯杳。\n愁对落花蹊。\n沉吟无语，辽西梦断，月照幽闺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"少年游 秋夜","author":"沈榛","text":"桂枝袅袅静飞香。\n月影淡筛窗。\n落叶飕飕，修篁簌簌，促织弄新腔。\n鸿声嘹唳云中度，烟树隔苍江。\n几许柔情，无端幽思，独坐对银釭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"少年游 春晚","author":"沈榛","text":"飞花处处满天涯。\n乳燕语谁家。\n红艳初稀，绿阴渐暗，蜂倦各归衙。\n小窗日晚多愁绪，柳絮趁风斜。\n粉蝶心慵，黄鹂声巧，寂寞负韶华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南柯子 蓼花","author":"沈榛","text":"野岸依幽渚，寒波浸碧空。\n数枝蓼蕊吐芳丛。\n雅淡红妆醉舞、向西风。\n赋色虽多别，含辛总自同。\n寂寥低映水仙宫。\n弱体轻盈常傍、小桥东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 春望","author":"沈榛","text":"红萼吐林花。\n望断天涯。\n迟迟旭影转窗纱。\n莺唤梦魂惊睡起，宝髻初斜。\n拾翠倦乘车。\n苕递春赊。\n东风玉马响檐牙。\n无限幽怀谁可语，诉与韶华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江月晃重山 立春","author":"沈榛","text":"雪馆絮飞初散，冰池澌澌旋开。\n东君芳讯喜才回。\n双胜好，春色上鸾钗。\n堤畔和风报柳，溪头淑景催梅。\n宜春小字贴幽斋。\n盘供饼、且与醉深杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中花 旅怀","author":"沈榛","text":"帘外冰蟾光的皪。\n良夜永、重门寂寂。\n烛影轻飘，凉飔微度，抚景悲羁客。\n云际翩翩排雁翼。\n频怅望、故乡消息。\n助我凄凉，几声清漏，泪并铜壶滴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 重阳","author":"沈榛","text":"嘹唳飞鸿寥廓游。\n溶溶碧渚浪花浮。\n眼看菊蕊黄金笑，首插茱萸白发愁。\n携桂楫，坐兰舟。\n满林红叶正深秋。\n龙山此日还吹帽，笑酌香醪泛玉瓯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 秋风","author":"沈榛","text":"几度飕飕响碧霄。\n峥嵘秋色满蘅皋。\n时来小院飘疏箨，复向长河卷怒涛。\n松谡谡，竹萧萧。\n薄罗衾冷梦无聊。\n那堪对此凄清候，独坐幽窗读离骚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 芙蓉","author":"沈榛","text":"淡荡微红簇翠翘。\n数枝斜傍碧溪坳。\n风欹舞袖霓裳敛，露浥朝霞脸晕潮。\n依蓼渚，向兰桡。\n锦帆分影映波遥。\n自怜贞性同黄菊，不逐丹枫到处飘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 秋蝉","author":"沈榛","text":"何处疏蝉唱晚凉。\n园林暑退淡秋光。\n随风响振听还远，抱叶吟残意自扬。\n张薄袂，饰残妆。\n琴声旧识蔡中郎。\n共知饮露清标在，不用凄其诉夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 渔舟","author":"沈榛","text":"烟水苍茫一叶舟。\n村醪处处独倾瓯。\n片帆风急从摇曳，双桨波平任溯流。\n聊忘世，更无愁。\n绿蓑作枕睡船头。\n晚来堤柳寒烟起，倚棹长歌卷钓钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河传 隋堤","author":"沈榛","text":"容与。\n江浦。\n隋堤深处。\n碧水依然。\n落花如雨。\n炀帝歌舞三千。\n闲游携绛仙。\n黄鹂宛转垂杨老。\n琼花好。\n忽失西京道。\n悲怀肠断，昔人永绝迷楼。\n恨扬州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞美人 初夏","author":"沈榛","text":"钩帘满院萋萋草。\n瞁睆流莺好。\n亭亭榴蕊未舒花。\n袅袅游丝缭乱、逐风斜。\n碧阑干外消凝久。\n绿树清阴逗。\n青阳顿去晓窗空。\n拂拂熏风吹尽、一庭红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉楼春 春思","author":"沈榛","text":"芳林无数飘红蕊。\n绿映裙腰芳草地。\n金炉缭绕自生烟，罗袖轻盈唯掩泪。\n东风吹面云层起。\n柳线搓绵空旖旎。\n三春寂寞重含情，几处雕栏愁独倚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南乡子 春闺","author":"沈榛","text":"绿树荫庭稠。\n暖日烘晴蜂蝶游。\n香梦乍回帘未卷，悠悠。\n起立悲怀倚画楼。\n紫茸注清瓯。\n槛外新篁翠欲浮。\n春色三分看过尽，休休。\n点点飞花点点愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瑞鹧鸪 咏柳","author":"沈榛","text":"几株烟柳占韶年。\n叶染鹅黄锁碧烟。\n枝倦恰逢新雨后，绿飘常趁晚风前。\n金衣下上音频换，玉剪参差影乍迁。\n描得双蛾添秀色，莫教独倚画阑边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行 春闺","author":"沈榛","text":"飘拂东风，葳蕤芳草。\n翩翻蝶趁晴光好。\n房栊寂寞倦凭栏，静看花影幽阶扫。\n独对韶华，慵开襟抱。\n博山强自添龙脑。\n香奁鸾镜启还收，任它红杏临窗笑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙 赏桂萧林","author":"沈榛","text":"傍砌几枝初放萼，西风时引幽香。\n玲珑金粟半舒黄。\n三秋佳赏，月下共持觞。\n影入筵前疑欲舞，几惊世界清凉。\n恍闻碧落奏霓裳。\n姮娥此际，应自妒吴刚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙 赏荷遁溪","author":"沈榛","text":"一曲池塘新水绿，画桥通处清幽。\n娉婷小立似含羞。\n绿罗翻翠羽，红映倚兰舟。\n潋滟波光晴载酒，衔杯且共渰留。\n风吹薄醉听吴讴。\n碧云飞远浦，白鹭起放洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思 病中诉怀","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"思悬悬。\n望悬悬。\n人去天涯欲会难。\n音书更杳然。\n愁恹恹。\n病恹恹。\n愁病支离葬玉颜。\n问君怜不怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 秋晓","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"雾敛云收，乱风拂拂生杨柳。\n鸟啼莺奏。\n帘幕寒重透。\n镜影棱棱，自觉新来瘦。\n双眉皱。\n颦残翠岫。\n玉颜难如旧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 忆别","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"悔煞当年，别时不把归期定。\n雁鱼路梗。\n两地无书信。\n昨夜西风，梦断愁难醒。\n纱窗静。\n碧梧相映。\n疑是萧郎影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 秋海棠","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"嫩绿娇红，无端艳夺春工巧。\n自怜窈窕。\n寂寂潜踪好。\n懊恨当年，误入萧萧草。\n知音少。\n愁思萦抱。\n肠断秋风早。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 春夜和研北齐韵","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"风飘帘縠。\n何处春砧声断续。\n月色清圆。\n偏照愁人妆镜奁。\n双星羞觑。\n对景空吟肠断句。\n欲问清光。\n何事离愁不暂忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"误佳期 闰六月七日为天孙戏","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"无限欢情今夕，伫盼盈盈脉脉。\n银河依旧鹊桥虚，暗把金钗掷。\n低语问牛郎，何事还相隔。\n佳期咫尺竟成非，屈指浑如昔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 暮冬望家报不至","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"寒风冽。\n纷纷不禁飘银雪。\n飘银雪。\n愁怀不异，去年时节。\n一从别后人如月。\n衡阳雁断音书绝。\n音书绝。\n惊闻又是，暮冬除夕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 其二","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"伤情切。\n苍苍烟树云重叠。\n云重叠。\n天涯苕递，谁传鱼贴。\n双眉蹙损纤纤月。\n容光消减心相意。\n心相意。\n背人无语，泪痕偷拭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春 清明即事","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"淡烟漠漠锁妆楼。\n嫩寒浅雨初收。\n东风无力柳丝柔。\n啼鸟含愁。\n引起深闺幽思，无端恨压眉头。\n华须偷卜问归舟。\n双泪盈眸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三段子 牡丹","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"春光如绣。\n翠阴浓嫩霞初逗。\n娇香自许占三春，绿肥红瘦。\n倚新妆，纤腰无力供长昼。\n临风时展青衫袖。\n只恐东风无计、留春久。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三段子 秋夜云掩月","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"空庭寂静。\n渐胧胧碧梧弄影。\n西风薄幸送闲云，清光掩映。\n叹嫦娥，何如薄命人萦恨。\n闲云漠漠何时尽，天上人间两负、良宵景。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三段子 早春忆别","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"东风吹彻。\n破轻黄画檐柳色。\n落梅如雪砌空阶，寒窗寂寂。\n记当年，歧亭分手心如裂。\n罗衫常得啼痕湿，别恨离愁脉脉、和谁说。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳梢青 湖亭晚望","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"曲曲青山。\n溶溶碧涧，堤柳垂烟。\n风送蘋香，松阴避日，凉浸珠帘。\n清溪翠竹朱栏。\n凝望处、□□心闲。\n澹澹斜阳，萧萧芦荻，鸦鸟留连。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 吹箫","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"碧树蝉吟晴日，绿窗昼永如年。\n深闺寂寞倩谁怜。\n惟有琼箫为伴。\n不怨天涯人远，自嗟凤侣无缘。\n欲传幽恨向君边。\n只恐西风吹断。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行 白莲","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"天巧玲珑，一团香雪。\n亭亭时恐东风折。\n绿波翻影澹涟漪，娇含晓露迷蜂蝶。\n不近红妆，偏怜明月。\n西池昨夜新开彻。\n芳心何事万丝萦，秋风情薄催离别。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行 七夕感怀","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"皓月初明，轻云试巧。\n双星偏向离人照。\n去年寂寞怅银河，今宵又被天孙笑。\n水榭花庭，秋容遍绕。\n衡阳雁断音书杳。\n孤房独宿恨沉沉，罗衾辗转天难晓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行 仲春拟雁别燕","author":"蒋纫兰","text":"东阁梅残，落红万点。\n柳丝风绕黄金线。\n画檐双燕舞翩跹，年年窥社来庭院。\n粉箨初成，梨花始艳。\n遥天别雁愁无限。\n萋萋芳草总销魂，参商隔面难为伴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":24457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]